flowchart LR
  Direct[operation/in value] --> Input[Portable InputValue]
  StepIn[step/in value] --> Input
  Input --> Reserved{Reserved vector head?}
  Reserved -->|no| Literal[Portable literal]
  Reserved -->|yes| Ref[Validate typed reference]
  Ref --> Step[step output]
  Ref --> Event[event path]
  Ref --> Workflow[workflow input]
  Ref --> Trigger[trigger payload]
  Ref --> Resource[resource id]
  Ref --> Explicit[explicit literal wrapper]
  Ref -->|malformed| Finding[Structural finding]
  Config[operation/with] -. plain PortableValue .-> Literal
  Wire[Workflow wire validation] -. may reject unresolved source kinds .-> Ref
